@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F3
skinparam classBorderColor #42697A
skinparam ArrowColor #42697A
hide empty members
title Code - Evidence indexing and querying
class "IndexStats" as IndexStats <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/evidence_search.py#L13]] {
  meeting_count
  segment_count
  action_count
}
class "EvidenceSearch" as EvidenceSearch <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/evidence_search.py#L426]] {
  close()
  search_segments(query, limit)
  search_meetings(query, limit)
  open_audio_span(meeting_id, start_ms, end_ms, track)
  get_confirmed_actions(meeting_id)
}
class "rebuild_evidence_index" as rebuild_evidence_index <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/evidence_search.py#L174]] {
  (artifact_root, index_path)
}
rebuild_evidence_index --> IndexStats : returns rebuild counts
EvidenceSearch --> rebuild_evidence_index : same derived schema; explicit rebuild is separate
@enduml
